identifier: Endurance-Compat
name: Endurance Compatibility Patch
abstract: Fits the Endurance parts pack to a USI-based mod list - reactor heat production is zeroed and life support moves to the current USI-LS modules
$kref: '#/ckan/github/starmatch666-droid/Endurance-Compat'
license: MIT
author:
  - Cyber1j1e
resources:
  homepage: https://github.com/starmatch666-droid/Endurance-Compat
tags:
  - config
comment: >-
  Intentionally does not depend on Endurance: that mod is not on CKAN (NetKAN has no
  Endurance identifier). ModuleManager, CommunityResourcePack and USI-LS are genuine
  dependencies. DeepFreeze is optional and only needed for the medical bay's
  cryo-sleep. The patch is a no-op when Endurance is not installed.
depends:
  - name: ModuleManager
  - name: CommunityResourcePack
  - name: USI-LS
install:
  - find: Endurance_适配
    install_to: GameData
